    <data key="d0">Pernod Ricard URL Shortener and Analytics Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Global URL shortener using CloudFront, Lambda@Edge, and DynamoDB, with an ETL and analytics backend using Firehose, S3, Glue, and Athena.</data>
